NGCC-AFS-KEX-C Implementations Directory

Directory structure
- Reference_Implementation/AFS_KEX_C128
  - Reference implementation of the KEX algorithm instance AFS_KEX_C128.
- Reference_Implementation/AFS_KEX_C256
  - Reference implementation of the KEX algorithm instance AFS_KEX_C256.
- Reference_Implementation/AFS_KEX_C512
  - Reference implementation of the KEX algorithm instance AFS_KEX_C512.
- Optimized_Implementation
  - Reserved for optimized implementation (currently empty).
- Additional_Implementation
  - Reserved for additional implementation variants (currently empty).

Reference_Implementation/AFS_KEX_C128/AFS_KEX_C256/AFS_KEX_C512 main files
- KEX_AlgorithmInstance.h/.c: API-required KEX interface wrappers.
- KAT_KEX.c: KEX KAT test driver.
- drng.h/.c: deterministic random generator used by KAT.
- randombytes_api.c: randombytes bridge to DRNG context.
- kem.c, indcpa.c, poly*.c, ntt.c, cbd.c, reduce.c, verify.c, symmetric-iccs.c, BWcoding.c:
  AFS-KEX core implementation used by this instance.
- Makefile: local build script for the `kat_kex` executable.

Build and verify
- cd Reference_Implementation/AFS_KEX_C128  # or AFS_KEX_C256 / AFS_KEX_C512
- make clean && make
- make kat
- The KAT file will be written to `../../../Test_Vector/KAT_KEX_<instance>.txt`.

Notes
- This workspace currently keeps KEX-related vectors only.
